flowchart LR
  User[Browser user] --> SPA[React SPA / Vite]
  SPA -->|Axios REST: cookie or Bearer JWT| API[Express 5 API]
  SPA <-->|Socket.IO: chat, presence, notifications| API
  API --> ODM[Mongoose]
  ODM --> Mongo[(MongoDB)]
  API --> Redis[(Redis: Socket.IO adapter and presence)]
  API --> GitHub[GitHub OAuth and REST API]
  API --> Cloudinary[Cloudinary media, when configured]
  API --> SMTP[SMTP via Nodemailer]
  Vercel[Vercel configuration] -. build/routing intent .-> SPA
  Vercel -. Node API builder .-> API
